      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">What Survivorship Bias Actually Shows</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"170\" width=\"800\" height=\"140\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#ef4444\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Not: this leadership style</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"265\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">reliably causes success</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"340\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10b981\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"400\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Instead: the visible sample of</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"440\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" text-anchor=\"middle\">celebrated founders over-represents</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"480\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" text-anchor=\"middle\">those who happened to succeed</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"600\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#6366f1\" opacity=\"0.5\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"660\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Founders using the same style</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"700\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">who failed are largely invisible —</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"740\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">no book gets written about them</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"900\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Correlation in a biased sample is not causation</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Survivorship bias distorts inference by showing only the successful subset of a much larger, mostly unseen population."
