      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"65\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">A Critical Reading Framework</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"130\" width=\"880\" height=\"130\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#6366f1\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"185\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1. Separate concrete tactics from broad philosophy</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Evaluate each independently</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"280\" width=\"880\" height=\"130\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"335\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2. Ask what the actual evidentiary base is</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"370\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pattern across many cases, or one author's story?</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"430\" width=\"880\" height=\"130\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"485\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3. Actively seek the counterfactual</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"520\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Find failures with the same style, successes with another</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"580\" width=\"880\" height=\"130\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10b981\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"635\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4. Weigh human costs against claimed benefits</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"670\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Stress and turnover are real costs, not virtues</text><rect x=\"110\" y=\"730\" width=\"880\" height=\"130\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#ec4899\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"785\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5. State what you'd keep, doubt, and what changes your mind</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"820\" font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Active, not passive, reading</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"920\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">No leadership book should be absorbed uncritically</text></svg>",
      "caption": "A five-step framework applies critical scrutiny to any leadership book's tactics, evidence, and hidden costs."
